    "title": "Patrick J. Washam | Obituaries | rutlandherald.com",
    "text": "Patrick J. Washam NEW BRUNSWICK, NJ — Patrick Joseph Washam, 93, passed away peacefully on September 10th, 2026, in New Brunswick, NJ. He resided for a time at The Meadows at East Mountain in Rutland, VT. Among the many loved ones who mourn their loss are his devoted daughters, Roseanne Smalley (Ocean View, DE, formerly of Mendon, VT), Patti Williams Kelley (Rutland, VT), and Heidi Baker (Middlesex, NJ). He was also the beloved father-in-law of the late Ernest N. “Ernie” Smalley and Mark J. Williams, Sr., also of VT. To read the complete obituary, please go to: www.mccrackenfuneralhome.com",
